# Files the EAS builder must not receive. Without this, EAS falls back to
# .gitignore, and anything untracked here gets uploaded.
#
# packages/smart-account is a workspace member on another branch; the leftovers
# on this one declare a file: dependency that is absent from this branch's
# lockfile, which fails npm install on the builder.
packages/smart-account/
.gstack/
**/*.devnet.bak
